SIMDe (SIMD Everywhere)
https://github.com/simd-everywhere/simde

A generated scalar subset is used as a portable reference in SIMD and
texture-processing unit tests. The vendored subset is test-only.
Source revision: 0ff5341927e15df0c3da8bb13bb32ec7f95aef84

The ARMv7 byte-table lookup in engine/dlib/src/simd/simd_neon.h is adapted
from SIMDe and retains its upstream MIT notice.

